{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1474","id":4012938625,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vMJWB","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1474","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1474.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1474.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1474","number":1474,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: add MS crop quality gate","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1460.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds the V1 MS crop quality gate as an artifact-only continuation of the page-first crop candidate pipeline from #1459. The new builder consumes the existing crop candidate, reveal gate, and display policy artifacts, then emits:\n\n- `post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.v1.json`\n- `post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.fixtures.v1.json`\n- `post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.readback.md`\n\nThe gate declares deterministic checks for target label visibility, previous/next question dominance, header/footer/noise-only crops, table/mark-scheme row preservation, page-boundary ambiguity, and readable resolution.\n\n## Important Count Posture\n\nThe true accepted/student-display crop count is zero in the real artifact because this issue does not generate real crop screenshots and no real Codex worker visual QA receipts exist. Accepted crop appears only as fixture-only contract coverage to prove the promotion rules and validator behavior.\n\nReal artifact counts include:\n\n- `source_crop_candidate_count = 69`\n- `crop_candidate_count = 69`\n- `crop_accepted_count = 0`\n- `page_fallback_required_count = 69`\n- `page_fallback_available_count = 69`\n- `student_display_candidate_without_visual_qa_count = 0`\n- `accepted_crop_without_visual_qa_count = 0`\n- `public_guessable_student_facing_crop_count = 0`\n- `production_side_effect_count = 0`\n\nFixture coverage includes accepted, candidate, quality-blocked with page fallback, ambiguous with page fallback, missing, and page-fallback cases.\n\n## Validator Rules\n\nThe validator fails closed if:\n\n- an accepted crop lacks automated quality pass or Codex worker visual QA pass.\n- an accepted crop bypasses display policy, reveal gate, source/self-assessment labels, or takedown controls.\n- a quality-blocked crop becomes student-facing without page fallback.\n- a student-facing crop uses public/static/guessable/pre-attempt delivery.\n- crop acceptance grants scoring or Smart Mark authority.\n- the exact visual QA zero-count fields are missing, renamed, or nonzero.\n- forbidden production, vector, RAG, frontend, OCR/VLM, or external model side effects are recorded.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-page-first-crop-candidates.test.js`\n- `npm run lint:changed`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.mjs`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-crop-quality-gate.mjs`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n","created_at":"2026-07-08T08:32:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T08:44:44Z","closed_at":"2026-07-08T08:44:44Z","merged_at":"2026-07-08T08:44:44Z","merge_commit_sha":"fef722eeb5be07faf73a56b481799775663f5161","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1474/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1474/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1474/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/baeea3507dff8e31cac74d098aa57bbcc9615c26","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1460","ref":"feat/issue-1460","sha":"baeea3507dff8e31cac74d098aa57bbcc9615c26","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/re